//RS //! One lossless provider-fact carrier shared by plans, locks, and explain.
//RS //!
//RS //! A provider adapter may project typed facts, but it may not discard the
//RS //! native document or hide a field it cannot prove.  This record is the one
//RS //! identity/provenance seam consumed by package profiles and semantic locks.
